Ender IO 5.3.72 for Horizon

This port is made from Ender IO 5.3.72 for Minecraft 1.12.2 (https://github.com/SleepyTrousers/EnderIO,
branch release/1.12.2) by the Ender IO team (CrazyPants, HenryLoenwind, tterrag and contributors).

Ender IO's code is released into the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode). Attribution isn't required, but it's given here
with thanks.

EnderCore 1.12.2-0.5.78 (https://github.com/SleepyTrousers/EnderCore), Ender IO's library, is CC0 1.0 too. This
port ships one of its textures, gui/widgets.png (the button frames of the machine screens), under the `endercore`
namespace.

